meta {
  name: Create Precious Metal Holding
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/holdings
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "assetType": "PRECIOUS_METAL",
    "management": "Degussa",
    "metal": "XAU",
    "quantity": "31.1035",
    "unit": "G",
    "purchasePrice": "93.24"
  }
}

docs {
  Authenticated request — requires the `vaultfolio_session` cookie captured
  by `auth/Login`.

  metal is one of XAU, XAG, XPT, XPD; unit is G (gram) or OZT (troy ounce).
  purchasePrice is the price per unit (here per gram). An equal position (metal +
  management) is merged in place and answered with 200 instead of 201. No ISIN.
}
